# Local dev secrets for `astro dev` (Miniflare reads this file as the Worker env).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in. Placeholders below are safe dummies.
#
# Public pages need NONE of these. Login/admin needs the auth block. Seeding local data
# from the live site needs the dev-seed block.

# ── Auth / admin (needed to log in locally) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Any non-empty string works locally; sessions are signed with it (HS256).
PRIVATE_JWT_SECRET=dev-only-change-me
# Break-glass admin login (email + password) — use these to sign in at /login locally.
SITE_ADMIN_EMAIL=you@example.test
SITE_ADMIN_PASS=dev-local-password

# ── Local dev data (npm run db:pull / auto-seed on npm run dev) ──────────────────────
# Personal token from an admin: `node scripts/mint-dev-token.mjs "Your Name"`.
# Pulls a sanitized, PII-free snapshot from the live site into your LOCAL D1.
DRBI_DEV_TOKEN=
# Where to pull from (defaults to https://drbi.org if unset).
# DRBI_SITE_URL=https://drbi.org

# ── Optional integrations (leave blank unless working on that feature) ───────────────
# Real values live in Cloudflare's secret store in production; these are only for local work.
# HUMANITIX_API_KEY=
# ZEPTO_SEND_TOKEN=
# ZEPTO_HOST=
# EMAIL_FROM=noreply@drbi.org
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID_SANDBOX=
# PAYPAL_SECRET_SANDBOX=
# PAYPAL_ENV=sandbox
# API_TOKEN=
# CRON_SECRET=
